# Direct main workflow

- Work on `main` by default. Do not create feature branches for normal changes.
- Commit and push to `origin/main` when the user asks to ship / push / save.
- Only use a branch + PR if the user explicitly asks for one.
- Before editing: `git checkout main && git pull` so work starts from latest main.
- Never force-push to `main`.
